      "source": "control-plane/run/machine.go:252",
      "notes": "The client handshake never opened the host session (CDT-679): the session/new response carried a JSON-RPC error, the child died before the session id landed, or the bounded wait expired with no id. An ACP child idles forever, so the named halt replaces the ride-on rule of CDT-665 AC6."
