      "source": "control-plane/run/machine.go:275",
      "notes": "The start carried a work premise and its session never took it: the bounded session wait expired after agent.start with no delivered agent.premise row (CDT-671 AC1). The closed undelivered pair stays the record. The takeover never selects this state, so the resume and retry verbs are the way back."
    },
